{"type":"message","id":"166ab5cb","parentId":"7f52814d","timestamp":"2026-04-03T04:23:44.630Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53c0421a8ca4eeae4277d086f94\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Fri 2026-04-03 04:23 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b53c0421a8ca4eeae4277d086f94]\nou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a: 如果我想关闭这个授权请求怎么做呢，先给方案，不着急改"}],"timestamp":1775190224626}}
{"type":"message","id":"cc4167b3","parentId":"166ab5cb","timestamp":"2026-04-03T04:24:02.895Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants to know how to disable the exec approval request (the ask confirmation before running commands). They want the solution first, not to change it immediately.\n\nLooking at the exec-approvals.json structure and the openclaw.json, there are a few ways:\n\n1. In openclaw.json, there's `security` and `ask` at agent/gateway level\n2. For exec specifically, the approval is handled by the exec-approvals.sock\n3. There's also `tools.exec.ask` or similar\n\nLet me think about what I know:\n- In workspace context, you can pass `ask: \"off\"` to exec calls\n- For agent defaults, you might set something like `\"ask\": \"off\"` for exec\n- There's `security: \"full\"` mentioned by the user\n\nLooking at the openclaw.json I read earlier, there's:\n```json\n\"agents\": {\n  \"defaults\": {\n    \"security\": \"full\",\n    \"ask\": \"off\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\nWait, the user showed me their desired format:\n```\n\"version\": 1,   \"defaults\": {     \"security\": \"full\",     \"ask\": \"off\"   },   \"agents\": {}\n```\n\nSo they want to add `security: \"full\"` and `ask: \"off\"` to the `defaults` object in exec-approvals.json.\n\nLet me give them the options to disable exec approval requests.","thinkingSignature":"5224dd5f60e48922aeb387c160153f2dc2809b40cec0aeff59e501ff06ef876b"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n几种方案：\n\n### 方案 1：在 `exec-approvals.json` 的 `defaults` 里加（你刚才提到的）\n```json\n{\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"defaults\": {\n    \"security\": \"full\",\n    \"ask\": \"off\"\n  },\n  \"agents\": {}\n}\n```\n⚠️ 但需要确认当前版本是否支持这两个字段，以及 `security: \"full\"` 的具体含义（是禁止所有还是要批准所有）\n\n---\n\n### 方案 2：在 `openclaw.json` 的 `agents.defaults` 里配\n```json\n\"agents\": {\n  \"defaults\": {\n    \"model\": { ... },\n    \"ask\": \"off\"\n  }\n}\n```\n控制 agent 默认行为，exec 调用时自带 `ask: \"off\"` 参数就不弹确认了。\n\n---\n\n### 方案 3：全局 socket 级别\n```json\n\"socket\": {\n  \"path\": \"...\",\n  \"token\": \"...\",\n  \"ask\": \"off\"\n}\n```\n这样所有通过这个 socket 的请求都不弹了。\n\n---\n\n### 方案 4：逐条加 `allow-always`\n把需要的命令一条条加进 `allowlist`，打上 `source: \"allow-always\"`。\n\n---\n\n**建议先确认：**\n1. 跑一下 `openclaw doctor` 看版本和可用字段\n2. 你想关掉是因为目前弹确认太烦，还是有特定场景需要？\n\n方案 2 最干净，方案 4 最安全（白名单可控）。你想用哪个？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"minimax-m2.5:free","usage":{"input":39,"output":619,"cacheRead":18120,"cacheWrite":1383,"totalTokens":20161,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775190224629,"responseId":"061e73d19aa25352f5482d3dce17c1b4"}}
