{"type":"message","id":"a7e6d57f","parentId":"65db6694","timestamp":"2026-04-03T04:24:46.211Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The exec finished - it was just the find command I ran earlier that found the exec-approvals.json file. I already read that file and replied to the user. No further action needed on this completion notification.","thinkingSignature":"f56f86a53b31583d22f5ef70aa7ae37e9b726a183b0caf23ff4ba7b320bfea1f"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n找到了文件位置，之前已经读过了。\n\n你的 `exec-approvals.json` 里 `defaults` 目前是空的：\n\n```json\n\"defaults\": {}\n```\n\n---\n\n**说回你的问题——关闭授权请求，最简单的方案：**\n\n把 `defaults` 改成：\n```json\n\"defaults\": {\n  \"ask\": \"off\"\n}\n```\n\n或者如果你看到的是这样的格式：\n```json\n\"defaults\": {\n  \"security\": \"full\",\n  \"ask\": \"off\"\n}\n```\n\n需要确认当前版本支不支持 `security` 字段。如果不确定，先只加 `ask: \"off\"` 试试。\n\n---\n\n**但要注意**：完全关闭 exec 授权有安全风险，建议：\n- 只关特定 agent（加在 `agents.lucus` 里而不是 `defaults`）\n- 或者只关某些安全命令\n\n你想先试哪个方案？\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"minimax-m2.5:free","usage":{"input":39,"output":226,"cacheRead":17951,"cacheWrite":1859,"totalTokens":20075,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775190274057,"responseId":"061e7402ebc07efc131d356275034e6b"}}
